            </note>
            <note corresp="#d126-f2" n="2" xml:id="d126-f2-content">
                <p>For a report of General Assembly action pertaining to Namibia, including a call
                    for Chapter VII sanctions against South Africa, May 23–31, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Yearbook of the United Nations, 1979,</hi> pp.
